Relevant columns and how they will be used  
(posts\_* = `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_*`,  `comments` = `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments`)

• `posts_questions.id` : primary‑key; lets us join every answer or applicable comment back to the owning **question**.  
• `posts_questions.tags` : holds the `<tag1><tag2>…` string we ultimately need.  
• `posts_questions.owner_user_id` : author of each question (filter on user id range).  
• `posts_questions.creation_date` : time filter to 2019‑07‑01 – 2019‑12‑31.  

• `posts_answers.id` : primary‑key for answers; joins to comments.post_id.  
• `posts_answers.parent_id` : FK pointing to the **question** that the answer belongs to (needed to fetch tags).  
• `posts_answers.owner_user_id` : author of each answer (filter on user id range).  
• `posts_answers.creation_date` : time filter.  

• `comments.post_id` : the post (question or answer) being commented on.  
• `comments.user_id` : commenter id (filter on user id range).  
• `comments.creation_date` : time filter.  

Predicate snippets that will be reused  
```
-- date window
WHERE  creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'

-- user‐id window
AND    user_id         BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208         -- for comments
AND    owner_user_id    BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208         -- for posts
```

Below are ten exploratory → increasingly complete queries (each returns ≤ 20 rows via `LIMIT 20`).

```sql
-- 1. Inspect questions in the date window and user‑id window
SELECT id, owner_user_id, tags, creation_date
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Inspect answers by those users in the same time window
SELECT id AS answer_id, parent_id AS question_id,
       owner_user_id, creation_date
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`
WHERE creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Answers + their parent‑question tags
SELECT a.id            AS answer_id,
       a.owner_user_id AS user_id,
       q.tags
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`   AS a
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
  ON   a.parent_id = q.id
WHERE  a.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  a.owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Comments in period by the user cohort
SELECT id AS comment_id, post_id, user_id, creation_date
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments`
WHERE  creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Comments that are directly on questions (post_id is a question)
SELECT c.id AS comment_id,
       c.user_id,
       q.tags
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments`        AS c
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
  ON   c.post_id = q.id
WHERE  c.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  c.user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Comments on answers (must hop through the answer to the question)
SELECT c.id          AS comment_id,
       c.user_id,
       q.tags
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments`        AS c
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`    AS a
  ON   c.post_id = a.id
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`  AS q
  ON   a.parent_id = q.id
WHERE  c.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  c.user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. UNION: all comments (on questions **or** answers) with the tags
SELECT c.id AS contribution_id,
       c.user_id,
       q.tags,
       'comment' AS contribution_type
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments` AS c
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
ON c.post_id = q.id
WHERE c.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND c.user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208

UNION ALL

SELECT c.id,
       c.user_id,
       q.tags,
       'comment' AS contribution_type
FROM `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments` AS c
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`   AS a
  ON c.post_id = a.id
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
  ON a.parent_id = q.id
WHERE c.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND c.user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Questions authored by cohort (already have tags)
SELECT id            AS contribution_id,
       owner_user_id AS user_id,
       tags,
       'question'    AS contribution_type
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE  creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Answers authored by cohort with their tags
SELECT a.id          AS contribution_id,
       a.owner_user_id AS user_id,
       q.tags,
       'answer'      AS contribution_type
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`   AS a
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
  ON   a.parent_id = q.id
WHERE  a.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  a.owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10. Final pattern: UNION of questions, answers, and all comments
SELECT id            AS contribution_id,
       owner_user_id AS user_id,
       tags,
       'question'    AS contribution_type
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`
WHERE  creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208

UNION ALL

SELECT a.id,
       a.owner_user_id,
       q.tags,
       'answer'
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`   AS a
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
  ON   a.parent_id = q.id
WHERE  a.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  a.owner_user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208

UNION ALL

-- comments on questions
SELECT c.id,
       c.user_id,
       q.tags,
       'comment'
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments`        AS c
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions` AS q
  ON   c.post_id = q.id
WHERE  c.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  c.user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208

UNION ALL

-- comments on answers
SELECT c.id,
       c.user_id,
       q.tags,
       'comment'
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.comments`        AS c
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_answers`    AS a
  ON   c.post_id = a.id
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.stackoverflow.posts_questions`  AS q
  ON   a.parent_id = q.id
WHERE  c.creation_date BETWEEN '2019-07-01' AND '2019-12-31'
  AND  c.user_id BETWEEN 16712208 AND 18712208
LIMIT 20;
```

Each successive query adds one more piece of logic until the tenth combines everything that is needed for the ultimate result (user id + question tags for every qualifying contribution).
